12. Key Takeaways
Remember:
Zero-Shot = Task without examples.

Role Prompting = Assign expertise/persona.

Context improves relevance.

Constraints improve accuracy.

Output format improves consistency.

Role + Context + Task + Constraints + Output = Professional-grade prompts.

For most real-world work, Role Prompting + Zero-Shot is enough to get high-quality results.

One-Line Summary
The quality of AI output is directly proportional to the clarity of the role, context, task, constraints, and output format you provide. 🚀


